  text    the text
  vocab   the vocabulary
  stoi    each character's place in the vocabulary, by character

decode  @3f94e289
  what    Tokens back to text: each token's character, joined into a string.
  tokens  the tokens
  vocab   the vocabulary

gpt_test_config  @8253c658
  what  Sizes small enough for a central-difference check of every
        parameter: five tokens, four positions, width eight, two heads, two
        blocks.

fd_check  @bf78c929
  what   Check one matrix's gradient against central differences of the loss:
         move each entry by h both ways and compare the change in the loss
         with the gradient's entry. The test calls it on every matrix.
  w      a matrix of the model, moved in place and put back
  g      its gradient
  x      the input tokens, batch by positions
  y      the targets
  found  `found[0]` the largest difference so far, `found[1]` the largest
         gradient entry
  m      the model, which reads `w` where it is
  h      the step of the central difference
  rows   w's rows
  cols   w's columns
  i      a row
  j      a column
  was    the entry before it is moved
  up     the loss with the entry moved up
  dn     the loss with it moved down
